    - Term: TutorialStep1
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - This training has begun
      - Dieses Training hat begonnen
      - "Cette formation a commenc\xE9"
      - "\u042D\u0442\u043E \u043E\u0431\u0443\u0447\u0435\u043D\u0438\u0435 \u043D\u0430\u0447\u0430\u043B\u043E\u0441\u044C"
      - "Bu e\u011Fitim ba\u015Flad\u0131"
      - "\u3053\u306E\u30C8\u30EC\u30FC\u30CB\u30F3\u30B0\u306F\u59CB\u307E\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F"
      - "Esta formaci\xF3n ya ha comenzado"
      - "To szkolenie si\u0119 rozpocz\u0119\u0142o"
      - "Questa formazione \xE8 iniziata"
      - "Este treinamento j\xE1 come\xE7ou"
      - Pelatihan ini telah dimulai
      Flags: 0000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Test
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Here I Will Test The Text For Errors And Other Actions, Understood, My Friend
      - Hier Werde Ich Den Text Auf Fehler Und Andere Aktionen Testen, Verstanden,
        Mein Freund
      - Ici Je Vais Tester Le Texte Pour Les Erreurs Et Autres Actions, Compris,
        Mon Ami
      - "\u0442\u0443\u0442 \u044F \u0431\u0443\u0434\u0443  \u0442\u0435\u0441\u0442\u0438\u0440\u043E\u0432\u0430\u0442\u044C
        \u0442\u0435\u043A\u0441\u0442 \u043D\u0430 \u043E\u0448\u0438\u0431\u043A\u0438
        \u0438 \u0438\u043D\u044B\u0435 \u0434\u0435\u0439\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0438\u044F
        \u043F\u043E\u043D\u044F\u043B \u0434\u0440\u0443\u0433 \u0442\u044B \u043C\u043E\u0439"
      - "Burada Metni Hatalar Ve Di\u011Fer Eylemler A\xE7\u0131s\u0131ndan Test
        Edece\u011Fim, Anla\u015F\u0131ld\u0131, Dostum"
      - "\u3053\u3053\u3067\u79C1\u306F\u30C6\u30AD\u30B9\u30C8\u306E\u30A8\u30E9\u30FC\u3084\u305D\u306E\u4ED6\u306E\u30A2\u30AF\u30B7\u30E7\u30F3\u3092\u30C6\u30B9\u30C8\u3057\u307E\u3059\u3001\u7406\u89E3\u3057\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3001\u79C1\u306E\u53CB\u4EBA"
      - "Aqu\xED Probar\xE9 El Texto En Busca De Errores Y Otras Acciones, Entendido
        Amigo."
      - "Tutaj Sprawdz\u0119 Tekst Pod K\u0105tem B\u0142\u0119d\xF3w I Innych Dzia\u0142a\u0144,
        Rozumiem, M\xF3j Przyjacielu"
      - "Qui Metter\xF2 Alla Prova Il Testo Per Errori E Altre Azioni, Capito, Amico
        Mio"
      - "Aqui Vou Testar O Texto Em Busca De Erros E Outras A\xE7\xF5es, Entendido,
        Meu Amigo"
      - Di Sini Saya Akan Menguji Teks Untuk Kesalahan Dan Tindakan Lainnya, Dipahami,
        Teman Saya
      Flags: 0000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
